#: ../../reference/exports.rst:4 bfb7cc015cf74f3bb0abf0343984ddf1
msgid "Exports"
msgstr "Exporte"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:6 afbc6fcf1b094f15b7c9a280b7b8e097
msgid ""
"Juntagrico uses `django_import_export <https://django-import-"
"export.readthedocs.io/en/stable/>`_ to provide customizable data exports."
msgstr ""
"Juntagrico nutzt `django_import_export <https://django-import-"
"export.readthedocs.io/en/stable/>`_, um anpassbare Daten-Exporte "
"bereitzustellen."

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:9 0cb8362bc8e2474bb24bf0a1510d5680
msgid "Export Formats"
msgstr "Export-Formate"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:11 40ca02aed7e9448c9b6e398f2c4936fb
msgid ""
"All formats supported by `tablib "
"<https://tablib.readthedocs.io/en/stable/formats.html>`_ can be used for "
"export. Some formats have additional dependencies. Add these to you "
"``requirements.txt`` if you want to export in these formats:"
msgstr ""
"Alle Formate, die von `tablib "
"<https://tablib.readthedocs.io/en/stable/formats.html>`_ unterstützt "
"werden, können für Exporte verwendet werden. Einige Formate haben "
"zusätzliche Abhängigkeiten. Füge diese zu deiner ``requirements.txt`` "
"hinzu, wenn du in diesen Formaten exportieren möchtest:"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:14 3f1cb31b397644ec9592c30350c145b5
msgid "xlsx: ``openpyxl>=2.6.0``"
msgstr "xlsx: ``openpyxl>=2.6.0``"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:15 6cf7ce3e809c44f7aabd549e4315b2dd
msgid "xls: ``xlwt``"
msgstr "xls: ``xlwt``"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:16 b16e32f5fdc446a09f2984f7593ea74b
msgid "ods: ``odfpy``"
msgstr "ods: ``odfpy``"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:17 6df5283af4164b4b9b8eea4ccb1a18d1
msgid "yaml: ``pyyaml``"
msgstr "yaml: ``pyyaml``"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:21 e126c74f84e44de1963f720d251a9d1a
msgid "Add Export"
msgstr "Export hinzufügen"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:23 25af559e9b7f48a39228344b202469c7
msgid ""
"Exports are defined in a ``Resource`` class. Read the `documentation of "
"django_import_export on how to define resources <https://django-import-"
"export.readthedocs.io/en/stable/advanced_usage.html#customize-resource-"
"options>`_."
msgstr ""
"Exporte werden in einer ``Resource``-Klasse definiert. Lies die "
"`Dokumentation von django_import_export zur Definition von Ressourcen "
"<https://django-import-"
"export.readthedocs.io/en/stable/advanced_usage.html#customize-resource-"
"options>`_."

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:27 862d970821e346ba9ee5263c7fc12c14
msgid "Example Resources"
msgstr "Beispiel-Ressourcen"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:47 e1283b7be7a0494c8b84a2190e59d740
msgid "Integrating your Resources"
msgstr "Integration deiner Ressourcen"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:49 298321d8b1f34d3e868f30d48003a54c
msgid ""
"You need to modify the admin classes, where the export shall be shown. "
"See :ref:`Custom Code <intro-custom-code>` on where to add this code."
msgstr ""
"Du musst die Admin-Klassen ändern, in denen der Export angezeigt werden "
"soll. Siehe :ref:`Eigenes Code <intro-custom-code>`, wo du diesen Code "
"hinzufügen kannst."

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:51 340769112b5a4c8986bb208625b3fbdd
msgid "If the admin already has an export, it is easy to add another one:"
msgstr ""
"Wenn der Admin bereits einen Export hat, ist es einfach, einen weiteren "
"hinzuzufügen:"

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:59 8975b17a9d6e44d48733190ec9119938
msgid ""
"Otherwise you will have to modify the existing admin with the "
"``ExportMixin`` class."
msgstr ""
"Andernfalls musst du den bestehenden Admin mit der ``ExportMixin``-Klasse"
" ändern."

#: ../../reference/exports.rst:62 a5fec706717e4e41ab7523dce3570240
msgid ""
"For admins that use the ``SortableAdminMixin``, use "
"``SortableExportMixin`` instead."
msgstr ""
"Für Admins, die ``SortableAdminMixin`` verwenden, verwende stattdessen "
"``SortableExportMixin``."
